+    },
+    {
+      "what": "Encrypting the eval (#828)",
+      "why": "The product owner dropped encryption and closed #828 on 2026-10-26: the eval stays in plain text, and the build is given the business intent through the stories, never the eval (ADR 057, section 7)."
